# Locked components

Full audit: `docs/ui-rules/locked-components.md`

## Use these (styling locked inside)

| Need | Component |
| ---- | --------- |
| Sidebar jump-to-date | `CalendarMiniPicker` |
| Planner sidebar | `CalendarSidebar` |
| Sidebar filter row | `CalendarSidebarToggleRow` |

## Never in apps/web

```tsx
// ❌
<Calendar classNames={{ nav: 'absolute …', week: 'flex w-full' }} />

// ✅
<CalendarMiniPicker selected={anchor} onSelect={setAnchor} />
```

## Planned locks (use documented workarounds until extracted)

- **SplitView fill-height** → native `SplitView` with pixel widths (`defaultSidebarWidth`, `minSidebarWidth`, `maxSidebarWidth`), not percentage panels
- **Combobox toolbar filter** → only via `FilterToolbar` ghost classes until `appearance="toolbar"`

After editing locked files, run `pnpm test`.
